Package: power-monitor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Power Monitor Maintainers <power-monitor@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-pip, adduser, sudo, systemd
Recommends: curl
Suggests: ubuntu-drivers-common, nvidia-driver-550
Description: Real-time CPU/GPU/system power monitoring for Ubuntu
 Installs an isolated Python environment from a bundled offline wheelhouse,
 a read-only RAPL helper with a scoped sudoers rule, a systemd service and a
 hardware detection report. The web dashboard is enabled automatically.
 .
 Default dashboard: http://localhost:8010/
 Runtime state: /var/lib/power-monitor
